# Attributes for Header - AUX-TOPO
# ------------------------------
TITLE       NWC GEO Auxiliary Product - TOPO data
SUMMARY     Topography data Product of the NWC/GEO
KEYWORDS    Auxiliary
CDM         Image

# Palette Definition
# ------------------------------


# Attributes for Container data
# ------------------------------------
BLOCK_data
standard_name        height_above_mean_sea_level
long_name            Topography
units                m
valid_range          0.0 10000.0
_FillValue           -9999.0
BLOCK_END

